## 🗺️ The pipeline at a glance

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph PC["💻 On your PC"]
        A[Download NPPES V.2 zip] --> B[Unzip → find npidata_pfile]
        B --> C[Split into ~240 MB parts<br/>header in EVERY part]
        C --> D[Gzip each part with 7-Zip]
    end
    subgraph SF["❄️ In Snowflake"]
        E[Upload parts to NPPES_STAGE] --> F[INFER_SCHEMA builds NPPES_RAW]
        F --> G[COPY INTO • ~9.6M rows]
        G --> H[Derive NPI_TAXONOMY<br/>primary specialty per NPI]
        H --> I[Load NUCC crosswalk<br/>into NUCC_TAXONOMY]
        I --> J[Join into NPI_TAXONOMY_NAMED]
    end
    D --> E
    J --> K[(Join to MEDICAID_SPENDING<br/>on billing NPI)]
```

**On your PC:** get the file small enough to upload through a browser.
**In Snowflake:** load it, then boil 330 columns down to the 2 you actually need.

