## 🧯 Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Rows missing / columns don't line up on parts 2+ | Header only in the first part | Put the header row in **every** split part |
| First column looks like `NPI` but every join silently fails | UTF-8 **BOM** at the start of the file | `SKIP_BYTE_ORDER_MARK = TRUE` in the file format |
| Splitting/gzipping is slow, or files get locked | Working inside a **OneDrive**-synced folder | Split in a local folder (e.g. `Downloads`) |
| Snowflake won't auto-detect the archive | Used `Compress-Archive` (makes `.zip`) | Use **7-Zip → gzip** (`.gz`) |
| Row counts **doubled** after a reload | `part.csv` and `part.csv.gz` are different names to `COPY` | `TRUNCATE` + `REMOVE` before reloading |
| `Remove-Item … used by another process` | 7-Zip / antivirus / Explorer preview holds the file | Add `-Wait` to 7-Zip; retry the delete; exclude the folder from AV |
| `COPY` seems to hang forever | No warehouse running | Start a warehouse — `COPY` needs compute |
| Specialty names come back blank | Loaded the NUCC **Characteristics** file by mistake | Use the **Provider Taxonomy** CSV (`nucc_taxonomy_*.csv`) |
| Upload rejected — file too big | A part is over the **250 MB** limit | Lower `$maxBytes` (e.g. `200MB`) and re-split |

